<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:780px">
    <div class="faq">
      <details open><summary>What we collect</summary><div class="answer"><p>When you send a message, a group request or a private event request, we get what you type in: your name, email, phone number and the details of your request. We use it only to reply to you and plan your visit.</p></div></details>
      <details open><summary>Reservations</summary><div class="answer"><p>Table reservations are made through Toast, which handles your booking details under its own privacy policy.</p></div></details>
      <details open><summary>Analytics</summary><div class="answer"><p>We use Google Analytics to understand how people use this site, such as which pages are visited and how many people tap to call, get directions or reserve. Google Analytics uses cookies for this. You can opt out with Google’s <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">browser add-on</a> or by blocking cookies in your browser.</p></div></details>
      <details open><summary>Who sees it</summary><div class="answer"><p>Your messages go to the Do Si team and to Apnosh, the agency that runs this website for us. We don’t sell your information.</p></div></details>
      <details open><summary>Questions</summary><div class="answer"><p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> and we’ll help, including if you’d like us to delete a message you sent.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
